    "sections": {
        "description": "Marriage Counseling is designed for professionals offering relationship support and therapy services. It includes essential features such as appointment booking integration, service listings, contact forms, and responsive layouts for easy access on all devices. The clean design helps present information like counseling services, therapist profiles, session details, and client resources in a structured way. This theme is suitable for licensed counselors, therapists, psychologists, relationship coaches, and mental health clinics. It can also be used by individuals providing online therapy sessions or consultation services. Built with an SEO-friendly structure, fast loading speed, and customizable sections, it supports better visibility on search engines. Key elements like blog sections for relationship advice, testimonial areas, and secure contact options make it practical for real-world use. Marriage Counseling focuses on usability, accessibility, and clear communication, making it a functional choice for those offering professional counseling services online."
    },
